+/// soft-delete aware, PostgreSQL xmin row version. Mirrors
+/// <see cref="TenantAssignmentPolicyConfiguration"/> (WS-C1) and
+/// <see cref="TenantSignatureConsentTextConfiguration"/> (WS-C2). WS-B2 /
+/// spec §3.4.
